M107
;TYPE:Custom
; Filament-specific end gcode
G4 ; wait
M221 S100 ; reset flow
M900 K0 ; reset LA
M907 E538 ; reset extruder motor current
M104 S0 ; turn off temperature
M140 S0 ; turn off heatbed
M107 ; turn off fan
G1 Z42.7 ; Move print head up
G1 X0 Y200 F3000 ; home X axis
M84 ; disable motors
M73 P100 R0
M73 Q100 S0
